    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. that's a good start. when you say the universal model \"faces criticism for perpetuating colonial power dynamics,\" do you mean that's just one perspective critics have, or is there a consensus that these museum models are actually fundamentally problematic? like, is the universal museum idea even considered a viable or ethical model anymore in modern curation?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
